---
import TextPage from '../../components/TextPage.astro';
import { routes, useTranslations } from '../../i18n';
import { site } from '../../config';
const t = useTranslations('en');
---
<TextPage lang="en" title={t.meta.privacyTitle} heading="Privacy policy" alternates={routes.privacy}>
  <p><strong>Data controller:</strong> {site.person} ([TAX ID PENDING]), {site.name}. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  <h2>What data I collect and why</h2>
  <p>When you write to me through the form, by email or on WhatsApp, I process your name, your email or phone number and what you tell me in your message, solely to reply to you and, if you decide to, arrange sessions.</p>
  <p>If we start therapy, any health information you share is treated with the utmost confidentiality and under professional secrecy, for the purpose of providing psychological care.</p>
  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>Your consent when you send me a message and, where applicable, the contract for the provision of services. Health data is processed for the provision of health care (Art. 9(2)(h) GDPR).</p>
  <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
  <p>Enquiries that do not lead to therapy are deleted within one year at most. Clinical records are kept for as long as health regulations require.</p>
  <h2>Who it is shared with</h2>
  <p>I do not pass your data on to third parties. I use providers acting as data processors: the form service (Formspree), email, WhatsApp and the video call platform. Some may be located outside the European Economic Area, with appropriate safeguards.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can access, rectify, erase, object to, restrict or port your data by writing to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You can also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (aepd.es).</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This website does not use tracking or analytics cookies. If an external booking calendar is added, it only loads when you click the button to open it.</p>
</TextPage>
